# {{.Header}}
# The Tailscale mode (01 section 12, docs/connectivity.md): accept the WireGuard port of tailscaled in the table
# inet care-pi. The unit of the installer loads the table first ("nft -f"); this rule comes after it.
# Without the Tailscale mode, apply deletes this file and reloads {{.FirewallUnit}}.

[Service]
ExecStartPost=/usr/sbin/nft add rule inet care-pi input udp dport 41641 accept
ExecReload=/usr/sbin/nft add rule inet care-pi input udp dport 41641 accept
